UP-Slider.mcc/UP-Slider.mcc

/****** UP-Slider.mcc/UP-Slider.mcc ******
*
*   NAME
*       UP-Slider.mcc -- MUI class, themed horizontal slider
*
*   FUNCTION
*       The class has no UPA_ attributes of its own: it is driven by the standard MUI numeric attributes MUIA_Numeric_Min, MUIA_Numeric_Max and MUIA_Numeric_Value (and MUIA_FixWidth). Create it with MUI_NewObject("UP-Slider.mcc", ...) or UP_NewSlider.
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP_NewSlider
*
******/
